arry over 1.\n   - **Ten millions place:** \\(9 + 8 + 1 = 18\\) \u2192 Write 8, carry over 1.\n   - **Hundred millions place:** \\(3 + 7 + 1 = 11\\) \u2192 Write 1, carry over 1.\n   - **Billions place:** Carry over 1 \u2192 Write 1.\n\n3. **Combine all results:** The result of adding each column gives us the final sum.\n\nThus, the sum of 398,093,546 and 782,398,314 is \\(\\boxed{1180491860}\\).",
